# preset: 基础
# about: 私有网络和中国大陆直连，其余流量走主出口。

# One statement a line; '#' starts a comment.
#
#   route <id> region <XX> [fast] [gate] [ipv4]   nodes of a country, held on ONE node
#                                                  fast  follow the fastest instead
#                                                  gate  add a switch that cuts the route
#                                                  ipv4  its nodes dial IPv4 only
#   route <id> like <route>                        the same node as another route
#   route <id> regex "<expression>"                nodes whose name matches
#
#   <target> [flags] <kind>:<value> ...            target: a route, proxy, auto, direct, block
#     flags: udp tcp ipv4 ipv6                     kinds: domain full keyword regex cidr set
#     the same kind again means "or";                     process path port
#     different kinds all have to match
#
#   region <ID> name:<text> code:<XX> flag:<emoji> ...   a region of your own
#   notice "<regex>"                                     names that are notices, not servers
#
# A region route is strict: with no node in the region, what is sent to it is
# blocked, never sent out another country's node. Rules run top to bottom and
# the first that matches wins. Private addresses go direct before all of them.

direct set:geosite-cn
